    { "en": "I want to see the world.", "zh": "我想去见见世面。" },
    { "en": "If we win a lot of money we'll travel round the world and we'll stay at the best hotels.", "zh": "如果我们赢了很多钱，我们就环游世界，住最好的旅馆。" },
